network-policy (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Complete network policy management system
  * Support for Ethernet, WiFi, LTE, and WireGuard interfaces
  * Integrated nftables firewall with address groups and services
  * Health monitoring daemon with automatic failover
  * Policy-based routing with per-interface tables
  * DNS management following default route
  * System settings and user management
  * Comprehensive configuration validation
  * Runtime configuration reloading
  * Control tool for status and management

 -- Network Policy Team <network-policy@example.com>  Fri, 10 Jan 2025 18:00:00 +0000
